-- l4 batch re-prints the module it runs, and a decimal default reaches the
-- evaluator exactly: 0.10000000000000000001 does not survive a round trip
-- through a Double (review m1).

§ `R`
    GIVEN r IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 0.10000000000000000001

@export Is exact
GIVEN u IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is exact` IF r EQUALS 0.10000000000000000001

#EVAL `is exact` TRUE
